      "raw_intent": "Redesign desktop composition and anchored interactions\n\nThe owner finds the previous panel polish insufficient. Redesign bar density, hierarchy and coherent colors; make popovers anchor to actual controls and preserve geometry across refreshes. Inspect native previews and current runtime, improve compact content-specific panels, preserve transparent dock, right-to-left alerts-clock-weather order, fullscreen/autohide and minute-only streaming clock. Back up, verify, apply and publish to main. Resolve native signing continuity where existing local credentials allow without storing identity in Git.",
      "refined_intent": "Redesign desktop composition and anchored interactions\n\nThe owner finds the previous panel polish insufficient. Redesign bar density, hierarchy and coherent colors; make popovers anchor to actual controls and preserve geometry across refreshes. Inspect native previews and current runtime, improve compact content-specific panels, preserve transparent dock, right-to-left alerts-clock-weather order, fullscreen/autohide and minute-only streaming clock. Back up, verify, apply and publish to main. Resolve native signing continuity where existing local credentials allow without storing identity in Git.",
      "status": "refined",
      "updated_sequence": 3
    }
  },
