      "intent": "Redesign the desktop around compact Graphite/champagne/ice-blue styling, four separated right-side groups, immediate hover feedback, content-sized anchored native control panels and click-to-pin with Escape/outside-click dismissal. Derive anchors from real SketchyBar item rectangles and preserve position/scroll across routine refreshes. The owner explicitly likes the current WEATHER pane: preserve its existing header and hourly layout; add six matching icon cards immediately below the hourly row, for tomorrow through six days ahead with Fahrenheit highs/lows and Mitchell timezone boundaries. Keep alerts-clock-weather order, one-second minute-only clock, imperial ZIP97750 weather, native fullscreens, transparent dock and rollback. No valid local signing identities exist; do not weaken identity/OS consent. Activate only the final build and verify calendar consent separately.",
